# --- Secrets & local machine config (NEVER commit) ---
# .env: CockroachDB connection string, OpenAI/AWS keys
.env
# .mcp.json: contains cluster ID
.mcp.json
# .claude/: local agent/IDE settings
.claude/

# --- Python bytecode / caches ---
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.pyd

# --- Virtualenv ---
.venv/

# --- Test / tooling caches ---
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.mypy_cache/
# DeepEval CLI local-model config + telemetry (Item 8 judge points at NVIDIA NIM;
# the key is NOT stored here — it lives in .env's NVIDIA_API_KEY, read at runtime).
.deepeval/
.deepeval_telemetry.txt

# --- Local diagnostic output / logs ---
*.log

# --- Ephemeral probe scratchpad ---
# Every session's one-off probes land here. It was ALREADY treated as gitignored by NOTES, by
# ARCHITECTURE, and by tests/test_citations.py — and it was NOT, merely untracked. The effect was
# the same (probes never survive a session) but the CLAIM was false, which is the exact disease
# test_citations.py exists to kill. Making it true rather than rewording the claim: a probe that
# matters enough to cite belongs in scripts/, committed. See NOTES "FABRICATED VERIFICATION
# CITATIONS" and test_citations.py rule (C).
scratchpad/
**/scratchpad/

# --- Lambda build artifacts (rebuilt from build.py; wheels are large) ---
lambda/*/package/
lambda/*/*.zip


audit.md
